 which is the optimistic but oblivious Kafuka, whose enthusiasm is over-the-top and lethal to anyone she meets. With all the antics his students carry on, can Nozomu ever manage to find something good in life?","rating":{"sources":[],"value":0,"age":"N/A"},"current_season_id":9174,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}